  "answer": "Research complete. Here's a summary of the key findings on Fiji visitor arrivals:\n\n## Core July Figures (from Fiji Bureau of Statistics)\n- **July 2023: 93,483** (+19.3% vs. July 2022)\n- **July 2024: 98,332** (+5.2% YoY, record at the time)\n- **July 2025: 99,311** (+1.0% YoY, new all-time July record)\n\nNotably, YoY July growth **decelerated sharply** from +5.2% to +1.0%, indicating Fiji is approaching a high base near peak capacity.\n\n## Recent Monthly Series (2025–2026)\n| Month | Arrivals | YoY |\n|---|---|---|\n| May 2025 | 86,587 | — |\n| June 2025 | 92,693 | +0.1% |\n| **July 2025** | **99,311** | **+1.0%** |\n| Aug 2025 | 99,737 | — (2025's highest) |\n| Sep 2025 | 92,344 | −0.3% |\n| Oct 2025 | 88,255 | −1.3% |\n| Nov 2025 | 77,963 | +1.5% |\n| Dec 2025 | 84,995 | — |\n| Jan 2026 | 70,993 | +0.3% |\n| Feb 2026 | 54,219 | +9.6% |\n| Mar 2026 | 71,765 | +12.4% |\n| Apr 2026 | 79,724 | −0.8% |\n| May 2026 | 85,405 | −1.4% |\n| **Jun 2026** | **98,522** | **+6.3%** (latest available) |\n\n## Annual & Market Context\n- **2025 total: 986,367** (+0.3% vs. 2024's 982,938) — new record\n- Source markets 2025: Australia 45.9%, New Zealand 22.2%, USA 12.0%\n\nAll FBoS figures are provisional and subject to revision. The most recent data point is **June 2026 (98,522)**. Full sourced data has been submitted via structured output.",
